Z||000000||Lizzy||12-30-2001||09:48 PM||||When I start my Fiero, w/duke 4 cyl., it idles high and all is well. As i give it some throttle the engine revs but then drops 500rpms. It goes back and forth like this when i'm holding the gas pedal steady. It idles fine. After 2-3 minutes of warmup it goes away. I've checked and no codes have come up, so i've replaced the map sensor and that was not the problem. Any help would be appreciated.||||reg||9
Z||000001||88CoupeV6||12-30-2001||09:53 PM||||That sounds normal for most dukes. All the fieros I've had do the same thing.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88coupeV6.jpg">       <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>    <A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/nefa.htm" TARGET=_blank>Join New England Fiero Association</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Return of Fiero||12-31-2001||12:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>That sounds normal for most dukes. All the fieros I've had do the same thing.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Doesnt sound normal to me, wish I knew what was wrong with your l4, but i know its NOT normal. My 84 sat from 1994 till about 20 days ago, without starting. I got it as a tip for a taxi ride, and was told that if i could make it run, to show it to the old owner. well, it runs, the idle is fine, and right into driving range, it doesnt sway the RPMs. If my duke has NO change in RPM, then either my car is broken, by being normal, or there is a problem there. Like I said, I wish I could tell you what it was, but I dont know. I only know your car is not acting normal. (just to affirm your asumtion is correct)<BR>Myke<BR>sorry I couldnt help||||reg||1
Z||000003||theogre||12-31-2001||05:26 PM||||check for vacuum leaks and EGR problems when it's cold. Sometimes either of those problems can be temperature sensitive.<P>also check all the alt/battery wire really good.<P>Those are what I'd start with.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
